      "body": "<p style=\"text-align: left\">Felix and Emil Fritsch founded and run the <strong>commons hub</strong> as a limited liability company.</p><p style=\"text-align: left\">However, over the past years, many people invested lots of time, resources and dedication into the Hub, which ultimately made it the welcoming and creative community space it is today.</p><p style=\"text-align: left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: left\">Do you have any comments, suggestions, questions or concerns?</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><strong>Let us know!</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-blue-600 underline button\" href=\"https://x.com/CommonsHubAT\">commons hub on X</a>   <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-blue-600 underline button\" href=\"https://t.me/joinchat/Vcg9sAXnJ1XY5BBn\">Crypto Commons Telegram</a></p>",
