      "body": "<h1 style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>not your standard event location</strong></span></h1><p style=\"text-align: left\"><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">From intimate team retreats, project weeks and nonprofit offsites to multi-day conferences, hackathons, and community gatherings — the <strong>commons hub</strong> makes for unforgettable experiences.</span></span></p><h5 style=\"text-align: left\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 24px\"><strong>Our Vibe</strong></span></h5><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">Laid-back, but intentional. </span></span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">Minimal formalities. Maximum freedom.</span></span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">The kind of place that feels familiar, even at first sight.</span></span></p><h5 style=\"text-align: left\"><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\"><strong>OUR PHILOSOPHY</strong></span></span></h5><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">We believe in “<strong>events as commons</strong>” — </span></span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">shaped by mutual care, respect, and serendipity. </span></span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">The magic begins where structure gives way for emergence and surprise.</span></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left\"><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Common areas</strong></span></h3><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">Several common areas embed and connect our dedicated event spaces:</span></span></p><h5 style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Lounge</strong></span></h5><img class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-md\" src=\"https://admin.commons-hub.at/assets/c34b64ac-4708-45cd-a5d3-7997299ccf2d\"><h6 style=\"text-align: left\"><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">The heart of the house — vintage couches, a weathered bar, and a vinyl record player for late-night moods.</span></span></h6><h5 style=\"text-align: left\"><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Shared Kitchen</strong></span></h5><img class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-md\" src=\"https://admin.commons-hub.at/assets/207602ff-b38e-4ff1-aab4-85aaeb57dce5\"><h6 style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">Once the heart of a restaurant, our kitchen is stocked with enough pots and pans to feed a small revolution.</span></span></h6><h5 style=\"text-align: left\"><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Garden</strong></span></h5><img class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-md\" src=\"https://admin.commons-hub.at/assets/8b60bc3d-0411-40c7-9970-832d583aef24\"><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">Big enough for frisbee, cozy enough for quiet moments. Includes a fire bowl, herb beds, and a FarmBot with a life of its own.</span></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left\"><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Event Space packages</strong></span></h3><h6 style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\"><em>All prices include 20% VAT. Bookings are binding after a 30% down payment.</em></span></span></h6><h5 style=\"text-align: left\"><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Small</strong> &nbsp;(up to 15 people) </span></h5><h6 style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">€200/day for our Seminar Room</span></span></h6><img class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-md\" src=\"https://admin.commons-hub.at/assets/b59ca884-b473-4790-b723-f03ac422cd55\"><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">45 m2 Seminar Room</span></p><h5 style=\"text-align: left\"><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\"><strong>Medium</strong> (up to 35 people) </span></span></h5><h6 style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">€500/day for Seminar Room + 2 Event Halls à 90m²</span></span></h6><img class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-md\" src=\"https://admin.commons-hub.at/assets/e622aeb9-d965-4c91-94b9-4afa01e2ad3d\"><h6 style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">90 m2 Conference Hall</span></h6><h5 style=\"text-align: left\"><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\"><strong>Large</strong> (up to 65 people)</span></span></h5><h6 style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">€700/day for Seminar Room + 2 Event Halls à 90m²</span></span></h6><img class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-md\" src=\"https://admin.commons-hub.at/assets/a2c41157-09ff-48a5-bfba-3d42e6c75d32\"><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">Main Stage with piano, A/V and live streaming setup</span></p><h5 style=\"text-align: left\"><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\"><strong>Extra Large</strong> (up to 100 people)</span></span></h5><h6 style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">€1000/day for Seminar Room + 2 Event Halls à 90m²</span></span></h6><img class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-md\" src=\"https://admin.commons-hub.at/assets/f003a65e-a9a3-4171-ac2b-b616ef984cf1\"><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">90 m2 Workshop Hall, here used for an exhibition</span></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left\"><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong><em>HOW TO BOOK</em></strong></span></h3><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">We’re working on our own booking app — but for now, email works best.<br>Send a message to </span></span><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-blue-600 underline\" href=\"mailto:office@commons-hub.at\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">office@commons-hub.at</span></span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\"><br>with the subject <strong>\"Booking: Event Space\"</strong> and include:</span></span></p><ul><li><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">A short event description</span></span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">Number of participants</span></span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">Desired space package (Small / Medium / etc.)</span></span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">First and last event day</span></span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">Catering: €35/person/day or self-catering?</span></span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">Any open questions</span></span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\">Three time slots for a first call</span></span></p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px\"><strong>Our team will get back to you shortly with the next steps.</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p>",
